<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Equipment</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>equipment</a>
<a cmd='#'>equipment all</a>
</pre>
<p>Lists everything you are using, and what you use it for: what you wear, what 
you wield and what you hold. equipment all lists every place from head to toe, 
with nothing where you have nothing. A thing that gives light, such as a burning 
torch, is marked (light), and one that darkens is marked (dark).
</p><p>These are the places you can wear and hold things:
</p>
<pre>head, left ear, right ear, neck (two), body, about body, across chest, back,
arms, wrist (two), hands, left finger, right finger, waist, legs, ankle (two),
feet, shield, wielded, held, or a weapon or thing used with both hands
</pre>
<p>A thing can only go where it was made to go, and where it fits you. Wear things 
with <a cmd='#'>Help Wear</a>, wield weapons with <a cmd='#'>Help Wield</a>, take them off with 
<a cmd='#'>Help Remove</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Inventory</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wield</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove</a>
</pre>




</div>